ota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-14T14:13:49.039-0500","size":87686,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62335","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62335"},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62402","id":"62402","filename":"row-height.svg","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-15T08:11:35.259-0500","size":324,"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62402"}],"description":"h3. What\n\nReplace the Material stand-in icons with the design's Lucide icons in the switcher, Tech View and Board View.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS1-R9a: the switcher uses List = list, Tech View = user-round, Board View = square-kanban (Lucide, 20px). In Tech View and Board View: density row-height (Tech View) / card-height (Board View), collapse chevron-down, pin / pin-off, Invoiced or Paid lock, Unassigned avatar user-round, empty states clipboard-list. List's icons are unchanged.\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v51|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S1-R9a).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nMaterial icons: view_list, person and view_kanban in the switcher; format_line_spacing for density; expand_more / chevron_right, push_pin, Material lock, person and assignment in the views.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Compare each icon against the design screenshots attached.\n* List's toolbar and rows show the same icons as production.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test cases for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590110|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590110] Display switcher and toolbar icons in Tech View and Board View match the design\n* [C590114|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590114] Tech View cells show a blue number, a thin progress bar and the advisor's avatar\n* [C590117|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590117] Tech View group header shows grip, arrow, grey initials avatar, name and count\n* [C590119|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590119] Board View column header shows grip, avatar, name, pin and count as designed\n* [C590122|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590122] Empty groups, empty columns and no-results pages look as designed","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57812/comment/78732","id":"78732","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [~accountid:712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e] for QA: please test this against PRD v51 S1-R9a once it is ready. The \"How to check\" list in the description is what passing looks like, and the attached screenshots show the staging build next to the design.","updateAuthor":{"self":"ht